      "paperId": "667b2ab1fb068051a0e3d074c667c4d61e1427f0",
      "title": "Mechanical Creativity in the Shift from the Absolute of German Idealism to Real Thinking: Towards a Transcendental Materialism of Film-Philosophy",
      "authors": [
