      "paperId": "0f7baf62f335c4c5a2172b219e7d9a5361557cae",
      "title": "\u201cLogologia.\u201d Fichte\u2019s Kantian Self-Interpretation of the Wissenschaftslehre in the \u201cAphorisms on the Essence of Philosophy as Science\u201d from 1804",
      "authors": [
